Armani Ferrante, CEO of Backpack, on opening up the entire global stock market on Solana

"Right now we have a set of symbols on Solana. It’s not just about those symbols. I want everything you can access in a brokerage app accessible from a self custodial wallet. Not just the US stock market. Japan, Hong Kong, Korea, and have everything onchain. That’s the thing I’m most excited about.”

@armaniferrante @therollupco
